WHY IT RUNS o(N) TIME
THE 2 CALLS
call 1 -> median of medians -> 1/5n
call 2 -> throw one half of the input
since pivot guaranteed to be 'decent', largest possible search
at most if 70% of n (7/10n)

total = 20% + 70% = 90% of n -> 0.9
0.9 -> 0.81 -> ... ->
sum it all up
n + 0.9n + 0.81n + ...
n * 1/1-0.9 = 10n at mst


RECURRENCE
T(n) <= T(n/5) + T(size of subproblem 2) + O(n)
subproblem 2 -> 7n/10 and 3n/10

keep the subproblme sum below 100% (90%)

